# Benchmark: file io
# Workload: 60 rounds of write, append, read, exists check and delete on one
# small file in the current folder (the benchmark runner uses a temporary
# folder). Measures the file provider, not disk throughput.

path is "otter_benchmark_io.txt"
seen is 0
count from 1 to 60 as n
    write "line one" to path
    append " and two" to path
    read path into contents
    if file path exists
        seen is seen plus length of contents
    .
    delete file path
.
say "file io" seen
